# The facial gestures of an own head close up (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/face-cues.md, step 3 of its order):
# for each of the nine gestures of the face profile's cues a frame without it and a frame at its apex (the middle of
# its hold), <gesture>-rest.png and <gesture>-apex.png; then one on an npc's own head (Xardas, if
# characters.json lists NONE_100_XARDAS). Blinks are off, so no frame catches the lids. Needs an own head with cues:
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1280x720 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content root> BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/face-cues.bench
# The sheet of the frames: reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/cues/engine_sheet.py <bench out dir> <sheet.jpg>
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean 30
blink off
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam face 38 0 1
wait 1500
shot flash-rest
wait 300
facecue player flash
wait 140
shot flash-apex
wait 700
shot doubt-rest
wait 300
facecue player doubt L
wait 525
shot doubt-apex
wait 1100
shot smirk-rest
wait 300
facecue player smirk L
wait 400
shot smirk-apex
wait 1000
shot press-rest
wait 300
facecue player press
wait 350
shot press-apex
wait 900
